{"page":218,"lines":[{"h":0.02183116428435794,"text":"learn to obey the first commandment in which all other","conf":1,"x":0.13064134223624174,"y":0.92732558136484677,"w":0.82185269640637704},{"y":0.90325337327249822,"text":"commands are included, and which requires that we should","x":0.1329154487677314,"w":0.81969432087687699,"conf":1,"h":0.024112673032851473},{"conf":1,"x":0.13056525814621978,"w":0.6082859782429485,"h":0.023481465521312916,"text":"\"fear, love and trust God above all things\"","y":0.88207072056737423},{"x":0.73107887208738975,"text":". So let us con-","conf":1,"y":0.88500123291377941,"w":0.22408842111562755,"h":0.021448397447192513},{"text":"clude with the words with which Luther in the Larger","y":0.86036706389777662,"conf":1,"w":0.82185269640637681,"x":0.13064135737875909,"h":0.020446888984195777},{"x":0.13064134490845059,"w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.83720930250804693,"h":0.020429586607312422,"text":"Catechism sums up his comment on the first commandment:","conf":1},{"w":0.79390944443739841,"text":"\"Hence let us learn well the first commandment, where we","y":0.81290206188562242,"h":0.026345003218877894,"x":0.15881940436699965,"conf":1},{"w":0.82185269640637681,"conf":1,"text":"see how God will tolerate no presumption, nor trust in any","h":0.0203488365052239,"x":0.13064135460757947,"y":0.7921511631911865},{"text":"other thing, and demands of us nothing further than a hearty","conf":1,"x":0.13064133527235774,"y":0.76884920589565442,"h":0.021848468553452349,"w":0.81947742808948865},{"x":0.12826603536166795,"w":0.82422801426478798,"h":0.021871539335402201,"conf":1,"text":"confidence in all that is good; hence that we walk up-","y":0.74702380947780334},{"x":0.12826604399792021,"conf":1,"y":0.72383720945956576,"text":"rightly and straightforwardly on our way in life, and use the","w":0.82185269640637693,"h":0.021802325097341368},{"text":"wealth which God gives us no further than an old cobbler","w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.020435354066273503,"conf":1,"y":0.7020348838694811,"x":0.1282660482813722},{"h":0.021831164284357829,"y":0.67732558141935262,"conf":1,"text":"uses his needle, bodkin and thread, or as a guest uses his inn,","w":0.82185269640637681,"x":0.13064134357828433},{"h":0.021825396825396859,"y":0.6555059520594152,"x":0.1282660591602319,"w":0.82185269640637693,"conf":1,"text":"food and bed, solely for his temporal need, each man in his"},{"w":0.81710211023107748,"conf":1,"text":"place according to God's ordinance; only let nothing on","h":0.02184270014838563,"y":0.63368055564156411,"x":0.13064134246165848},{"text":"earth become our master or idol.\"","y":0.61334325406209889,"h":0.018924187100122891,"w":0.46793345661906455,"conf":1,"x":0.12826605610258163},{"conf":1,"text":"Hence let us say: \"Not to us, O Lord, not to us, but to","y":0.58854166690497867,"w":0.78622327532087055,"h":0.020585317460317443,"x":0.16152019693406761},{"conf":1,"x":0.12826605906521996,"y":0.56540697705888743,"w":0.82185269640637693,"h":0.021894610117352165,"text":"Thy name give glory\" (Ps. 115: I). Let us try to silence our"},{"h":0.028185537883213541,"conf":1,"w":0.82004641248034182,"text":"restless tormented hearts with their desires and claims, that","x":0.12802011169242297,"y":0.54151457744680342},{"y":0.52033730166824399,"w":0.62945368382837863,"h":0.020360372369251589,"text":"the power of God may truly control our lives.","conf":1,"x":0.12589072898842366},{"h":0.02630721576630124,"w":0.2939740961248225,"y":0.49139201555517265,"text":"\"Let nothing vex you","x":0.36235528369971726,"conf":1},{"text":"With lasting sorrow.","conf":1,"x":0.38242280615072455,"y":0.47093023265581824,"w":0.28028503021636564,"h":0.020389211556268161},{"x":0.38004750948831112,"conf":1,"w":0.23515438723873783,"text":"Be still, O heart;","y":0.44766865062329764,"h":0.021825396825396748},{"x":0.37994263668145384,"y":0.42400677275504484,"conf":1,"w":0.22586294892546416,"text":"As God ordains,","h":0.022625989384121414},{"x":0.37962743197492455,"h":0.019364860322740318,"y":0.40435252663438459,"text":"So be content,","conf":1,"w":0.20051032227355159},{"conf":1,"text":"And bear thy part.","x":0.38004750434881729,"y":0.38219246060732615,"h":0.018970329610128234,"w":0.26365795383205659},{"w":0.25653207456910759,"conf":1,"x":0.36104512500760771,"y":0.35610465127663682,"h":0.023359634573497434,"text":"\"Why bear to-day"},{"conf":1,"y":0.33720930302382479,"h":0.018941490423111662,"w":0.26365795383205665,"x":0.38004750820867478,"text":"To-morrow's care?"},{"text":"The One above","x":0.38004750919855812,"y":0.3139534887261336,"w":0.21615201776677906,"h":0.01744185932098874,"conf":1},{"text":"All things controls,","w":0.26189164991502639,"y":0.28771256292191394,"conf":1,"h":0.022004805860065368,"x":0.37979449031963314},{"conf":1,"text":"Supplies thy needs,","y":0.26453488374493406,"h":0.021923449304368736,"w":0.26603324691970626,"x":0.37767221525748645},{"conf":1,"x":0.37910796620835185,"w":0.11124241816533076,"y":0.24602026293788826,"h":0.017869883113437179,"text":"In love."},{"conf":1,"h":0.022920659610203398,"y":0.21746408884346502,"w":0.22830841758034448,"x":0.36090517526203358,"text":"\"In all thy ways"},{"w":0.17380197946127363,"conf":1,"x":0.37746955832207885,"y":0.19410342847793116,"h":0.021676863942827529,"text":"Be steadfast,"},{"text":"And rest","conf":1,"w":0.11929538033225318,"y":0.17517290372078109,"x":0.37978223931882615,"h":0.018840239161536876},{"text":"In what God wills;","conf":1,"w":0.26742306003322852,"x":0.37706351837372115,"y":0.15095650433258556,"h":0.023000922467973584},{"y":0.12398885280998617,"conf":1,"text":"There lies thy peace,","x":0.37648931237065464,"w":0.29246577968845122,"h":0.030139548437935981},{"w":0.25653204979834626,"conf":1,"h":0.0189299555051895,"x":0.37767221981579119,"y":0.10755813976074335,"text":"That is the best.\" 1"},{"y":0.087209302679621903,"h":0.017453396131121846,"text":"1 P. Fleming.","conf":1,"x":0.45130641768480734,"w":0.1496436998441622},{"h":0.013081395436847054,"text":"222","y":0.068313953607884614,"x":0.50831353974645865,"w":0.047505936065277532,"conf":1}],"h":11508,"w":7029}